    "description": "The Logistics Shipments ETA Retrieval API provides users with real-time estimated arrival times for logistics shipments. This endpoint allows clients to access detailed information regarding shipment statuses and forecasted delivery times, enhancing supply chain visibility. Typical consumers of this API include logistics operations teams, shipment tracking applications, and inventory management systems seeking to optimize delivery schedules. With this information, businesses can improve planning and customer service by staying informed about shipment timelines.",
